{
    "title": "myColorado",
    "description": "As the State of Colorado's official mobile app\u2122, myColorado\u2122 provides a secure and convenient way for Coloradans to access important state services anytime, anywhere!\r\n\r\nmyColorado allows you to:\r\n- create your Colorado Digital ID\u2122 to complement your physical ID card for in-state use*\r\n- show proof of vaccination wherever it\u2019s required\u2028 with myVaccine Record\r\n- view the latest COVID-19 updates and helpful resources\r\n- access a digital version of your Colorado Parks and Wildlife fishing license\r\n- store your vehicle registration, auto insurance card and other important documents in the digital wallet\r\n- look up Colorado state sales tax rates for specific locations\r\n- browse State of Colorado job listings\r\n- connect to other online state services and more!\r\n\r\n*Users must have a Colorado driver license or state-issued ID to create an account.\r\n\r\nVisit myColorado.gov for more information.\r\n\r\nPlease note the app is only made available for download on Google Play on Android devices.",
    "descriptionHTML": "As the State of Colorado&#39;s official mobile app\u2122, myColorado\u2122 provides a secure and convenient way for Coloradans to access important state services anytime, anywhere!<br><br>myColorado allows you to:<br>- create your Colorado Digital ID\u2122 to complement your physical ID card for in-state use*<br>- show proof of vaccination wherever it\u2019s required\u2028 with myVaccine Record<br>- view the latest COVID-19 updates and helpful resources<br>- access a digital version of your Colorado Parks and Wildlife fishing license<br>- store your vehicle registration, auto insurance card and other important documents in the digital wallet<br>- look up Colorado state sales tax rates for specific locations<br>- browse State of Colorado job listings<br>- connect to other online state services and more!<br><br>*Users must have a Colorado driver license or state-issued ID to create an account.<br><br>Visit myColorado.gov for more information.<br><br>Please note the app is only made available for download on Google Play on Android devices.",
